# PART 8: What reconFTW Does That PHANTOM Doesn't

reconFTW is the closest open-source equivalent to PHANTOM's recon pipeline. It uses 80+ tools.
Tools in reconFTW **not** in PHANTOM:

```
dnsx           → DNS bruteforce + validation
puredns        → Massdns-based subdomain resolution  
resolver       → Custom DNS resolver management
gau            → Fetch URLs from AlienVault, Wayback, URLscan
getallurls     → Wayback Machine URL fetcher
waybackurls    → Historical URL discovery
trufflehog     → Secret scanning in URLs/JS
nuclei-templates (full set) → Custom org-specific templates
proj discovery  → httpx, dnsx, naabu (full ProjectDiscovery suite)
subjack        → Subdomain takeover
crt.sh scraper → Certificate transparency
favfreak       → Favicon hash recon
cloud_enum     → AWS/GCP/Azure bucket brute force
s3scanner      → Public bucket finder
gufw           → AWS account finder
cairdns        → DNS rebinding
manifinder     → Google manifest scraping
webscreenshot  → Mass screenshot tool
EyeWitness     → Web screenshotter with credential detection
```

